        "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium-wide shot frames a small neighborhood corner store at night during heavy rain. a handsome man in a dark green coat waits beneath the awning, notices an old friend across the street, and freezes with one hand still wrapped around a paper cup. The camera trucks left with small amplitude at slow speed as passing headlights sweep across her face. [Shot 2] At 00:04.000, the camera cuts to a street-level tracking shot as she steps into the rain and the friend moves toward her; they meet beside the center line and share a relieved embrace while traffic remains stopped in the background.\n\noverall_soundscape: Heavy rain strikes the awning and pavement while distant engines idle. Wet footsteps approach from opposite sides, fabric rustles during the embrace, and both people release quiet, unsteady breaths.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Sparse piano notes at a slow tempo, joined by a low sustained cello tone that grows slightly during the embrace and then fades.",
        0,
        "entire text as one"
      ],
